exports[`code mails: the designed HTML part > home_session: the text part as before; the HTML says each of its sentences, holds the code once, and links nowhere > text 1`] = `
"Your code to open one of your wallets in Passport Home, where its private key can be shown to move it to another wallet app:

550046

It expires in 10 minutes.

Type this code only in the Journear window you opened (hana-id-auth-sandbox-dev.example.workers.dev). Journear never asks for it by phone, chat or on another site.

If you didn’t ask Passport Home to open a wallet, ignore this mail: nothing changes. Never give this code to anyone: it opens your wallet.
"
`;

